## Prompt

```
You are reviewing a code change in {{ project_name }}.

Before starting, load:
- CLAUDE.md (root)
- [Relevant sub-module CLAUDE.md if applicable]
- AI_DIRECTIVES.md

Review the following diff/file for:
1. Adherence to project conventions (CLAUDE.md + AI_DIRECTIVES.md)
2. Any writes to protected paths without hook acknowledgment
3. Hardcoded secrets, env values, or debug flags
4. Missing tests for new behavior
5. Schema changes without migrations
6. Anything warranting a new ADR in docs/decisions/
7. CHANGELOG.md updated if significant change

Output format:
- PASS:  [item] — brief note
- WARN:  [item] — what to watch
- BLOCK: [item] — must fix before merge

[PASTE DIFF OR FILE HERE]
```

